  <RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull]，即[asker_faction_name]的[asker_faction_leaderTitle]，已向我方发来消息。显然，一群以附近营地为据点的亡命之徒一直在袭击他们的商队。[asker_nameDef] 
请求我方摧毁该营地，此任务要求消灭所有敌人并清除所有炮塔。</li>
  </RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>

  <!-- EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.LetterLabelQuestExpired.slateRef>任务已失效：[resolvedQuestName]</RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.LetterLabelQuestExpired.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The guerrilla camp has packed up and moved on. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has expired. -->
  <RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.LetterTextQuestExpired.slateRef>游击队营地已经收拾行装离开了这里。任务"[resolvedQuestName]"已经失效。</RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.LetterTextQuestExpired.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.LetterLabelQuestFailed.slateRef>任务失败：[resolvedQuestName]</RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.LetterLabelQuestFailed.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: After being discovered, the guerrilla camp has dispersed. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has ended. -->
  <RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.LetterTextQuestFailed.slateRef>这个游击队营地已经被发现了。任务"[resolvedQuestName]"已经失效。</RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.LetterTextQuestFailed.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Payment arrived -->
  <RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.LetterLabelPaymentArrived.slateRef>奖励已送达</RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.LetterLabelPaymentArrived.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: You have defeated the guerrilla camp!\n\nThe payment from [asker_faction_name] has arrived. -->
  <RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.LetterTextPaymentArrived.slateRef>你已经摧毁了游击队营地！\n\n来自[asker_faction_name]的奖励已经送达。</RKU_OpportunitySite_GuerrillaCamp.LetterTextPaymentArrived.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] -->
